### Etibé Fiat Ramp - Local Testing Environment
#
# Requirements:
# 1. Install the "REST Client" extension in VS Code.
# 2. Start the backend: `npm run dev`
# 3. Start ngrok in a separate terminal: `npx ngrok http 3000`
# 4. Fill in your Nomba test keys in the `.env` file.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
# Replace this with the token you get after logging in via your normal auth flow
@authToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. GET FIAT WALLET & BALANCE
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get/Create My Fiat Wallet (this creates the Nomba virtual account placeholder)
GET {{baseUrl}}/fiat/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Fiat Balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/fiat/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. BANK ACCOUNTS (OFF-RAMP DESTINATIONS)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Supported Banks
GET {{baseUrl}}/fiat/banks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Add a Bank Account (Replace with valid Nigerian bank details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fiat/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "institutionCode": "044", 
  "accountNumber": "0000000000"
}

### Get Saved Bank Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/fiat/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. ON-RAMP (NGN -> cNGN)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get On-Ramp Quote (e.g., for 5000 NGN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fiat/deposit/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000
}

### (The actual deposit is triggered when Nomba sends a webhook for funds received)

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. OFF-RAMP (cNGN -> NGN)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Off-Ramp Quote (e.g., for 5 cNGN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fiat/withdraw/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5
}

### Request Withdrawal OTP (check your email or console logs for the OTP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fiat/withdraw/request-otp
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Initiate Withdrawal
# Note: Ensure you have NGN balance in your fiat wallet first
POST {{baseUrl}}/fiat/withdraw/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cNgnAmount": 5,
  "institutionCode": "044",
  "accountNumber": "0000000000",
  "accountName": "TEST ACCOUNT NAME",
  "otp": "ENTER_OTP_HERE"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. WEBHOOK SIMULATION (FOR LOCAL TESTING WITHOUT NGROK)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------
# To manually test the webhooks, you need the actual HMAC signature, 
# which is difficult to mock manually. It is highly recommended to use 
# ngrok and trigger real test payments from the Nomba/Paycrest sandboxes.
